  "content": "<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/43170ec70307413fcd326cff227fa6b1c6a6036c_0.webp\" alt=\"Create: Access Denied - 为你的物流网络提供简单的权限管理。\" width=\"100%\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7bfd9ede8da9adc1a1d2040db888e6b4f03070fb_0.webp\" alt=\"通过简洁的界面控制访问权限。Shift+点击玩家头像可移除其权限。输入用户名并点击加号图标即可添加玩家。\" width=\"100%\">\n<a href=\"https://github.com/5w14/create-access-denied\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c737b005a946748fc278824b23ec4dc9a43fc153_0.webp\" width=\"49.7%\" alt=\"GitHub - 问题与源代码\"></a> <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/fw14\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c476f7e6f09d2bdd412f0235fa2c53dc8a2ad34c_0.webp\" width=\"49.73%\" alt=\"Ko-fi - 支持我\"></a><br>\n\n<br>\n\n<details>\n<summary>文本描述</summary>\n\n# Create: Access Denied\n> 为你的物流网络提供简单的权限管理。\n\n通过简洁的界面控制物流网络的访问权限：\n - Shift+点击玩家头像移除其权限\n - 输入用户名并点击加号按钮授予权限\n\n[GitHub上的问题和源代码](https://github.com/5w14/create-access-denied)\n\n[在Ko-Fi上支持我](https://github.com/5w14/create-access-denied)\n\n</details>",
